Subject: [PATCH 326/341] =?UTF-8?q?TechDraw:=20a=20new=20section=20view's?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20caption=20is=20translatable=20(=E6=96=AD=E9=9D=A2=20A-A=20in?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Japanese)?=
